 azazuley-veira (23.0.2-1) noble; urgency=medium
 .
   * Release Azazuley Veira 23.0.2 for Launchpad.
   * Carry the current Azazuley source, Sydonic Magicae Translation Matrix,
     bundled TardiSHA GrimChain runtime, embedded Python runtime, and native kernels.
   * Remove the obsolete Pillow/PyMuPDF runtime-package requirement.
